@startuml SD-04_Explorer_AccessPlatform
title SD-04 · Explorer — access the platform

actor Explorer
participant "Explorer app" as App
participant "CDN" as CDN
participant "Identity & access" as IA
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Google" as G

Explorer -> App : Open JobQuest
App -> CDN : Load app bundle
CDN --> App : App bundle
App --> Explorer : Show sign-in screen

alt sign in with password
  Explorer -> App : Enter email, password
  App -> IA : Sign in
  IA -> DB : Load account
  DB --> IA : Account
  IA -> IA : Verify password hash
else sign in with Google
  Explorer -> App : Choose Google sign-in
  App -> G : Redirect to Google
  Explorer -> G : Approve sign-in
  G --> App : Authorization code
  App -> IA : Sign in with code
  IA -> G : Exchange code
  G --> IA : ID token
  IA -> IA : Verify ID token
  IA -> DB : Find or create account
  DB --> IA : Account
else register
  Explorer -> App : Fill in registration
  App -> IA : Register
  IA -> IA : Hash password
  IA -> DB : Create account
  DB --> IA : Account
end

break wrong details or account disabled
  IA --> App : Sign-in refused
  App --> Explorer : Show error message
end

IA -> DB : Start session, log sign-in
IA --> App : Session token, quiz status

alt quiz not done
  App --> Explorer : Show Get-to-know-me quiz
else quiz done
  App --> Explorer : Show Galaxy Map
end
@enduml
